"Brutes are the physical class, with few spells and tightly focused skills."
"Their focus leaves them little versatility."
"An S-rank Brute is a titan; a C-rank Brute is middling."
"Arjun Thomas is an S-rank Brute focused almost purely on physical strength."
"Brutes are about 30% of the chosen, the most of any class, and the most traded."
"Brute subtypes include Longsight, Morph, Speedster, Agility, strength-type and Audial."
"Audial Brutes are held able to overhear things and even to cure tinnitus."
"Brutes get many foundational points."
"Brute types include vocal Brutes, who may perform opera for off-island jobs."
"Combat-class C-ranks are rarely summoned, mostly for appearances."
